@startuml
!theme plain
title 用戶認證流程 - Sequence Diagram
' Author: AuraTrade Team
' Version: 1.0
' Last Updated: 2026-01-29

actor User
participant "Web App" as Web
participant "AuthController" as Controller
participant "AuthService" as Service
participant "UserRepository" as Repo
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== 用戶登入 ==

User -> Web: 輸入 Email + 密碼
activate Web

Web -> Controller: POST /api/v1/auth/login\n{email, password}
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: login(email, password)
activate Service

' 查找用戶
Service -> Repo: find_by_email(email)
activate Repo

Repo -> DB: SELECT * FROM users\nWHERE email = ?
activate DB
DB --> Repo: 用戶資料
deactivate DB

Repo --> Service: User 實體
deactivate Repo

alt 用戶存在
    ' 驗證密碼
    Service -> Service: verify_password(\nplain_password,\nhashed_password)
    
    alt 密碼正確
        ' 生成 Token
        Service -> Service: create_access_token(\nuser_id, email, role)
        Service -> Service: create_refresh_token(\nuser_id)
        
        Service --> Controller: {\n  access_token,\n  refresh_token,\n  user_info\n}
        deactivate Service
        
        Controller --> Web: 200 OK +\nSet-Cookie: refresh_token\n(HttpOnly)
        deactivate Controller
        
        Web -> Web: 儲存 access_token\n到記憶體
        
        Web --> User: 登入成功\n導向首頁
        deactivate Web
        
    else 密碼錯誤
        Service --> Controller: InvalidCredentialsError
        deactivate Service
        Controller --> Web: 401 Unauthorized
        deactivate Controller
        Web --> User: 顯示「密碼錯誤」
        deactivate Web
    end
    
else 用戶不存在
    Service --> Controller: UserNotFoundError
    deactivate Service
    Controller --> Web: 401 Unauthorized
    deactivate Controller
    Web --> User: 顯示「帳號不存在」
    deactivate Web
end

== Token 刷新 ==

... 30 分鐘後 Access Token 過期 ...

User -> Web: 繼續操作
activate Web

Web -> Controller: GET /api/v1/stocks/...\nAuthorization: Bearer {expired_token}
activate Controller

Controller -> Controller: verify_token()
Controller --> Web: 401 Token Expired
deactivate Controller

Web -> Controller: POST /api/v1/auth/refresh\nCookie: refresh_token
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: refresh_access_token(refresh_token)
activate Service

Service -> Service: verify_refresh_token()

alt Refresh Token 有效
    Service -> Service: create_access_token(\nuser_id, email, role)
    Service --> Controller: new_access_token
    deactivate Service
    
    Controller --> Web: 200 OK + new_access_token
    deactivate Controller
    
    Web -> Web: 更新 access_token
    Web -> Controller: 重試原請求
    activate Controller
    Controller --> Web: 200 OK + 資料
    deactivate Controller
    Web --> User: 顯示結果
    deactivate Web
    
else Refresh Token 無效
    Service --> Controller: InvalidTokenError
    deactivate Service
    Controller --> Web: 401 Unauthorized
    deactivate Controller
    Web --> User: 導向登入頁
    deactivate Web
end

note right of Service
  JWT 安全機制：
  - Access Token: 30分鐘
  - Refresh Token: 7天
  - Refresh Token 存於
    HttpOnly Cookie
    (防止 XSS 攻擊)
end note

@enduml
